E AX3073 1004-undeclared-unsafe.ax:16:13-20 undeclared-unsafe "`main` touches raw memory and its declaration does not say so" #"__alloc" ?15:1:"write `;@axiom:effect(unsafe)` above the declaration"~>";@axiom:effect(unsafe)\n" ?"the unsafe tag marks a trusted boundary: you must make every well-typed call safe. It leaves ordinary type, effect and restriction checks in place"
